---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Alsonex Pharmaceuticals"
  description="Alsonex is a Brisbane-based clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company founded in 2014 out of University of Queensland research into neuroinflammation. Meet the leadership team and board behind ALS-205."
  route="about"
>
  <PageHead
    eyebrow="About Alsonex"
    title="Built to Tackle Neurodegenerative Diseases"
    lead="Alsonex is an Australian-based, clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company developing a new drug for some of the most confounding diseases of humankind. It is led by experienced drug developers with a track record of innovation and translation."
    watermark="About"
  />

  <!-- §1 — Origins (Split). -->
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <Split
      eyebrow="Our story"
      heading="Founded in 2014, Out of University of Queensland Research"
      image="/assets/about-origins-uq.jpg"
      imageAlt="Aerial view of the University of Queensland's St Lucia campus on a bend of the Brisbane River, with the Brisbane skyline beyond"
      caption="University of Queensland, St Lucia campus"
    >
      <p style="color:var(--ink-soft)">
        Alsonex is focused on the development of new treatments for neurodegenerative disease.
        Founded in 2014 from research being undertaken at the University of Queensland and elsewhere
        into the link between neuroinflammation and neurodegenerative disease.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-soft)">
        Neurodegenerative disease remains a complex and elusive goal for the pharmaceutical
        industry, but new research is shedding some light on the problem, and new treatments are
        emerging. Alsonex is positioned to provide part of the solution to slowing or reversing
        diseases such as Parkinson's, Alzheimer's, Huntington's and Motor Neuron Diseases.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-soft)">
        <strong>Our principal commercial objective.</strong> Our principal commercial objective is to
        develop a new drug treatment for people with neurodegenerative diseases, which aligns with our
        commercial objective to enhance shareholder value through clinical development of ALS-205.
      </p>
    </Split>
  </section>

  <!-- §2 — Our Approach (3-up CardGrid). -->
  <section class="section--tight" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="slabel reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow center">Our Approach</div>
        <h2 class="display h-lg" style="margin-top:16px">
          A Focused Path From the Laboratory to the Patient
        </h2>
      </div>
      <CardGrid cards={approachCards} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- §3 — Our Leadership Team (People grid — full board, real bios). -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="slabel reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow center">Our Leadership Team</div>
        <h2 class="display h-lg" style="margin-top:16px">
          Experienced Drug Developers and Proven Operators
        </h2>
      </div>
      <People members={leaders} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Affiliations — tidy logo strip. -->
  <section class="section--tight" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <div class="slabel reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow center">Our Affiliations</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="logos reveal">
        <li class="logos__item">
          <a
            class="logos__link"
            href="https://www.alsa.org/about-als/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
          >
            <img src="/assets/logo-als-association.jpg" alt="The ALS Association" />
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="logos__item">
          <a class="logos__link" href="https://www.mndaust.asn.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/assets/logo-mnd-australia.jpg" alt="MND Australia" />
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="logos__item">
          <a class="logos__link" href="https://www.mndandme.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/assets/logo-mnd-and-me.jpg" alt="MND and Me Foundation" />
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- §4 — Investor CTA. -->
  <section class="section--tight" style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:clamp(72px,9vw,120px)">
    <div class="wrap reveal">
      <CtaBand
        eyebrow="For investors & partners"
        heading={'Partner With Us to Bring <span style="white-space:nowrap">ALS-205</span> to Patients'}
        lead="Alsonex advances its programmes to proof-of-concept, then shares later-stage development with the right pharmaceutical partner."
        buttonLabel="Contact the team"
        buttonHref="/contact"
      />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
